msgid "在桃花妖留下并重新扩建的互助网络中，地方公所、宗族、寺庙与邻里组织共同承担生活资料的分配。收入降低的部分被公共供给、互助信用和非市场交换抵消，因此桃花妖不再把许多变化理解为消费危机。"
msgstr "Within the mutual-aid networks inherited from the Peach Blossom Spirits and rebuilt on a larger scale, local guildhalls, clans, temples, and neighborhood organizations share responsibility for distributing the means of life. Public provision, mutual credit, and non-market exchange offset lost income, so the Peach Blossom Spirits no longer interpret many changes as consumption crises."

msgid "将人类正式纳入蓬莱的地方共同体结构，允许他们加入桃花妖地方集团，并规定其他种族也可在本地获得同等资格。原本人类专属的政治要求不再以独立集团形式存在。"
msgstr "Formally incorporates humans into Penglai's local communities, allowing them to join Peach Blossom local groups and granting the same local status to other peoples. Political demands formerly exclusive to humans no longer exist as a separate group."

msgid "承认人类是蓬莱政治共同体的一部分，并禁止按种族区别民事与政治权利。"
msgstr "Recognizes humans as part of Penglai's political community and prohibits distinctions in civil or political rights based on people."

msgid "通过合作社制度，让劳动者共同持有部分生产资料并参与经营决策。南柯对就业增长的年度期望逐年降低，而消费要求相应提高。"
msgstr "Uses cooperatives to give workers collective ownership of part of the means of production and a role in management. Nanke's annual expectation for employment growth falls over time while their consumption demand rises accordingly."

msgid "赋予朝廷对议会法案的否决权。人类议席不再正常表决；只有当法案偏离帝国利益时，他们才会以统一的反对票阻止法案通过。"
msgstr "Grants the imperial court a veto over parliamentary bills. Human seats no longer vote normally; only when a bill departs from imperial interests do they cast a unified opposition vote to block it."

msgid "比翼的知识联合会正式取得国家主导权，并将议会从蓬莱政治中移除。"
msgstr "The Biyi knowledge federation formally takes command of the state and removes parliament from Penglai politics."

msgid "将重要银行、工场和商业设施纳入公共所有，使经济活动改由国家主导。现代派比翼不再以投资增长作为年度政治目标。"
msgstr "Places major banks, workshops, and commercial facilities under public ownership, shifting economic direction to the state. Modernist Biyi no longer treat investment growth as an annual political objective."

msgid "将种族事务交由各地区分别管理。比翼议席此后不再直接响应全岛统一集团，而是由各地区自己的利益组织影响。"
msgstr "Delegates affairs of each people to regional administration. Biyi seats no longer answer directly to island-wide groups and are instead influenced by interest organizations in their own regions."

msgid "人类在蓬莱成为大明体系中的特殊外藩人口，其政治地位独立于本地居民，也不再属于桃花妖公所。"
msgstr "Makes humans in Penglai a special outer dependency population within the Great Ming system, politically distinct from local residents and no longer part of the Peach Blossom guildhalls."

msgid "限制人口迁徙与外来永久定居，使人类更难把蓬莱当作普通的移居地。"
msgstr "Restricts migration and permanent settlement from outside, making it harder for humans to treat Penglai as an ordinary destination for immigration."

msgid "允许劳动者建立正式工会，并通过罢工参与政治。南柯提案更加频繁，南柯议员也会在不利于工人利益的法案上集体反对。"
msgstr "Allows workers to form formal trade unions and participate in politics through strikes. Nanke proposals become more frequent, and Nanke legislators collectively oppose bills harmful to workers' interests."

msgid "进一步向外来商人、移民与技术人员开放蓬莱。人类在蓬莱更容易生活和定居，但传统生活方式受到的冲击也更大。"
msgstr "Further opens Penglai to foreign merchants, migrants, and technical workers. Humans find it easier to live and settle on the island, while traditional ways of life face greater disruption."

msgid "允许大型企业、银行和工业资本进一步集中，使垄断性组织成为现代化的主要力量。现代派比翼不再以投资增长作为年度政治目标。"
msgstr "Allows further concentration of large firms, banks, and industrial capital, making monopolistic organizations a principal force of modernization. Modernist Biyi no longer treat investment growth as an annual political objective."

msgid "正式承认蓬莱属于大明政治秩序的一部分，但朝廷只保留较弱的制度性特权。"
msgstr "Formally recognizes Penglai as part of the Great Ming political order while leaving the court only limited institutional privileges."

msgid "限制政府干预经济的范围，同时继续保护本土企业、居民和基本公共结构。"
msgstr "Limits the scope of government intervention in the economy while continuing to protect local firms, residents, and basic public institutions."

msgid "对政治献金进行有限监管。献金仍然普遍合法，但较大的金额更容易引起调查与丑闻。"
msgstr "Introduces limited regulation of political donations. Donations remain broadly legal, but larger sums are more likely to trigger investigations and scandals."

msgid "确立朝贡关系，以岁贡换取大明对蓬莱内部政治的有限承认。"
msgstr "Establishes a tributary relationship, exchanging annual tribute for limited Great Ming recognition of Penglai's internal politics."

msgid "以比翼传统重新解释现代公共制度，使学校、行政与公共文化更多采用比翼语言与知识体系。"
msgstr "Reinterprets modern public institutions through Biyi traditions, bringing more Biyi language and systems of knowledge into schools, administration, and public culture."

msgid "将汉语、明式制度与人类政治文化作为蓬莱现代化的主要标准。"
msgstr "Makes the Chinese language, Ming institutions, and human political culture the principal standards of Penglai's modernization."

msgid "将主要利益集团正式纳入国家结构，使它们不再只是外部游说者，而成为制度化政治代表。人类原有的永乐局集团不再以独立形式存在。"
msgstr "Formally incorporates the major interest groups into the state, turning them from outside lobbyists into institutional political representatives. The former human Yongle Bureau group no longer exists independently."

msgid "南柯开始把梦中理想社会的制度完整带入现实：生产资料公有，重要资源统一配置，政治依靠对公共事务的直接参与而不是私人资本与利益集团运作。"
msgstr "Nanke begin bringing the institutions of their dreamed ideal society fully into reality: public ownership of the means of production, unified allocation of major resources, and politics based on direct participation in public affairs rather than private capital and interest-group bargaining."

msgid "建立普遍地方自治制度，由地方共同体自行处理大量事务。"
msgstr "Establishes general local autonomy, leaving a wide range of affairs to local communities themselves."

msgid "取消对外贸易限制，让商品和资本能够更自由地进出蓬莱，并对其他种族开放更多市场与居留机会。"
msgstr "Removes restrictions on foreign trade, allowing goods and capital to move more freely in and out of Penglai and opening more market and residency opportunities to other peoples."

msgid "将蓬莱明确作为大明的一省来治理，由朝廷制度直接决定其人类人口和政治结构。"
msgstr "Explicitly governs Penglai as a province of the Great Ming, with imperial institutions directly determining its human population and political structure."

msgid "保障公开批评、出版与政治讨论的权利，并降低国家对报刊和公共表达的干预。"
msgstr "Protects the rights of public criticism, publication, and political debate while reducing state intervention in newspapers and public expression."

msgid "要求政府公开关键财政、议会和行政信息，使腐败与秘密交易更难被掩盖。"
msgstr "Requires the government to disclose key fiscal, parliamentary, and administrative information, making corruption and secret deals harder to conceal."

msgid "允许朝廷的秘密警察系统在蓬莱长期活动，以维护帝国秩序并压制被视为威胁的政治活动。"
msgstr "Allows the imperial secret-police system to operate permanently in Penglai in order to preserve imperial order and suppress political activity deemed threatening."

# Dialogue
msgid "老板。"
msgstr "Boss."
msgid "你能不能有点坐相？"
msgstr "Could you at least sit properly?"
msgid "驻岁真的只剩我们两个了？"
msgstr "Are we really the only two Zhushui left?"
msgid "咱俩都认识多少年了，这屋里又没别人。我坐那么端正，给谁看？"
msgstr "How many years have we known each other? There's nobody else in here. Who am I supposed to sit up straight for?"
msgid "嗯。你一个，我一个。驻岁只是不会老，又不是不会死；死一个少一个，偏偏还生不回来。"
msgstr "Yeah. You and me. Zhushui don't age, but that doesn't mean we can't die. Every death leaves one fewer, and we can't make more."

msgid "一位驻岁画家留下的旧画。画的是他亲眼所见——大明宝船第一次驶入蓬莱，船影几乎遮住了整片海湾。"
msgstr "An old painting left by a Zhushui artist. He painted what he saw himself: the first Great Ming treasure ships entering Penglai, their silhouettes nearly covering the whole bay."
msgid "画这幅画的人呢？"
msgstr "What happened to the painter?"
msgid "那天后来怎样了？"
msgstr "What happened after that day?"
msgid "驻岁不会老死，却不是死不了。他后来总怕自己落在时代后面，什么都要赶，最后死在一场本不必发生的赶工事故里。"
msgstr "Zhushui do not die of age, but they can still die. He became terrified of falling behind the times and rushed everything, until he died in an accident caused by haste that never needed to happen."
msgid "起初是惊讶、畏惧，也有人欢喜。后来是争地、停市和战争。再后来谁也赢不了谁，只好坐到一张桌前——于是有了今天的议会。"
msgstr "First came amazement and fear, and for some, delight. Then came disputes over land, closed markets, and war. In the end no one could defeat anyone else, so they had to sit at the same table—and that became today's parliament."

msgid "一只素瓷瓶，最早是人类商船带来的舶货。几百年买卖往来以后，各族的器物、衣食和习惯早已你中有我——如今反倒很难说什么还只属于谁。"
msgstr "A plain porcelain vase, first brought here as cargo on human merchant ships. After centuries of trade, every people's objects, clothing, food, and habits have mingled so thoroughly that it is now hard to say what belongs to only one of them."

msgid "会同常见的灯。形制还是旧式的，材料、玻璃和做工却早已混进了几百年海贸带来的洋式手艺。"
msgstr "A common lamp in Huitong. Its form is still traditional, but its materials, glass, and workmanship have long absorbed techniques brought by centuries of maritime trade."
msgid "这算什么风格？"
msgstr "What style is this?"
msgid "它怎么亮的？"
msgstr "How does it produce light?"
msgid "没人特意给它起过名字。明制的骨架没变，洋布、玻璃、皮革和新工艺却早成了日用品。用久了，也就没人觉得它们是两回事了。"
msgstr "No one ever gave it a special name. The Ming-style frame never changed, while imported cloth, glass, leather, and newer techniques became ordinary materials. After long enough, no one thought of them as separate styles at all."
msgid "不烧油，也不用电。未然胆里的未然经引弦管路转成光，安静得像电灯，只是燃料来自蓬莱人的焦虑。"
msgstr "It burns no oil and uses no electricity. Weiran from the cell is carried through Yinxian conduits and converted into light, as quietly as an electric lamp—except its fuel comes from the anxieties of Penglai's people."

